<title>UK: Hiscox switches from MGAM - paper.</title>
<headline>Hiscox switches from MGAM - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Grenfell Asset Management (MGAM) has lost a contract to manage the investments of Hiscox Select Insurance Plc, the Financial Times said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The paper said Hiscox had taken the decision to change investment managers to Baillie Gifford due to disappointment with the level of returns while MGAM was managing.</p>
<p>Hiscox Select uses its assets to support underwriting activities at Lloyd's of London, the newspaper said.</p>
